{"resourceIdentifier":"4216","resourceName":"Wen County BCCY New Energy Co., Ltd Landfill Gas Direct Combustion Utilization Heating Project","description":"Wen County BCCY New Energy Co., Ltd landfill gas direct combustion utilization heating project (hereafter referred to as the project) is located at Wen County MSW landfill site, Baofeng Village North, Zhaobao Town, Wen County, Jiaozuo City, Henan Province, P.R. China. The project is invested, constructed, and operated by Wen County BCCY New Energy CO., Ltd. (hereafter referred to as the project owner). The objective is to collect the landfill gas (LFG) from Wen County MSW landfill site and utilize it to generate hot steam for the nearby factories.\r\nWen County MSW landfill site started collecting and handling waste in 2008 with a total design effective capacity of 590,000 m3 and a calculated operational lifespan of 25 years. The project has a total designed capacity 3.5t/h (1*3.5t/h) gas type boiler that combusts the LFG that contains nearly 50% of methane, to generate hot steam and export it to the nearby food industries. The project started to construct on 20/11/2020 and started to operate on 01/09/2021. The operation period of the project will end on 31/08/2031.\r\nThe LFG from Wen County MSW landfill site is greenhouse gas. In the absence of the project activity, the LFG would have released to the atmosphere, hence contribute to the global warming. Furthermore, the biogas utilized in the boiler replaces the fossil fuel that utilized in the food industries’ boilers. The gas boiler uses LFG will generate heat which will replace the Fuel-Gas type boiler and the biogas type boiler in the food industries. Therefore, the project activity significantly contributes to the reduction of GHG emission. \r\nTotal heat supplied to the food industries by using the LFG in the crediting period will be 396,767t. VCUs will be claimed from the methane destroyed and the diesel oil displaced. The estimated average GHG emission reductions of the project are 39,676tCO2e and the total GHG emission reductions and the removals are 39,676tCO2e during the fixed 10 years crediting period.","location":{"latitude":34.985554,"longitude":113.144441},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-03-17","endExclusive":"2023-04-17","endInclusive":"2023-04-16"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4216"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan BCCY Environmental Energy CO.,LTD."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 371 6552 1782"},{"type":"string","value":"lwang@bccynewpower.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4216"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"39832"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.C.,AMS-III.G."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"05/04/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/09/2021 - 31/08/2031"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=85696&IDKEY=0iofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq32118174784","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-Wenxian.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-03-02T03:22:48.167Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.a